msgid "guaranteed/tooltip/description1/"
msgstr "If all vehicles are already owned, you receive a Boon Lootbox instead."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/compensation"
msgstr "If you already own all the vehicles from the boxes, you will receive a Boon Lootbox as a reward instead of a vehicle."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr "Every %(guaranteed0)s Bounty, %(guaranteed1)s Bestowal, and %(guaranteed2)s Boon Lootboxes are guaranteed to contain a vehicle. If you open them without one dropping such a vehicle, then a vehicle you do not already own will drop when you open the %(guaranteed0)sth/%(guaranteed1)sth/%(guaranteed2)sth box (depending on the box type). When it does, the counter is reset."

